# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
# Exercise the five cost models added to the prelude: integer ALU,
# contracted FMA, integer multiply-add.  These are the measured models from
# tests/<arch>/results/2026-11-16, not local copies: a local definition here
# would shadow the prelude and test the wrong numbers.

ialu(a: u32, b: u32, c: u32) = (a + b) xor (c << 3)
fma(x: f32, y: f32, z: f32) = x*y + z
mad(a: u32, b: u32, c: u32) = a*b + c
use gfx90c
cost ialu
cost fma
cost mad
use gfx902
cost ialu
cost fma
cost mad
use gp107
cost ialu
cost fma
cost mad
use zen3
cost ialu
cost fma
cost mad
use zen1
cost ialu
cost fma
cost mad
